abstract: "Numerical reproduction of grouped calibration and bootstrap comparisons for multi-view grasp verifiers. Includes stored-score recalibration, saved-array simulation summaries, bounded deterministic regeneration, v8 table audits, and v12 targeted simulation and saved-result diagnostics. See LICENSE_SCOPE.md for the distinction between software and external data rights."
